 detailed definitions of the overall recommendation categories. While the official CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page exists and contains the review criteria, the specific scoring scale and overall recommendation definitions are not shown in the search results available to me. To access the complete scoring rubric with exact recommendation scale definitions, you would need to visit the full reviewer guidelines page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b41b243d-0e5c-47b1-83bb-7de38ac1f796","uuid":"4be1ab39-ae4b-40f7-84e1-eed2f537ca8a","timestamp":"2026-05-15T23:05:05.802Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines scoring rubric overall recommendation scale","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01U8VnpR5P4fRW5G29LkZMSK","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/"},{"title":"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2023%2FConference"},{"title":"ACL 2023 Acceptance Recommendations - ACL 2023","url":"https://2023.aclweb.org/blog/overall-recommendation/"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/"},{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions","url":"https://corl2022.org/frequently-asked-questions/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"Conference on Robot Learning","url":"https://twitter.com/corl_conf/status/1666663426339508224"},{"title":"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot","