{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MEYkg73xufMKB2bqWMrjpQ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 acceptance rate review score distribution statistics\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"Cornell University Acceptance Rate and Admissions Strategies\",\"url\":\"https://www.collegetransitions.com/blog/how-to-get-into-cornell-admissions-data-and-strategies/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found that Paper Copilot maintains detailed statistics for CoRL 2024, including acceptance rates and review score distributions. The search results indicate that the CORL 2024 statistics page (result index 2) con