{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01398jjE7f4kSsJRgtBn2x2r","type":"tool_result","content":"paper_framing.md:40:### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\npaper_framing.md:42:- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/paper_framing.md:27:### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/paper_framing.md:29:- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:7:  artifact。Discussion 中 pretraining confound 转化为 positive insight（\"vision-language\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/paper.tex:348:While this introduces a pretraining confound (SigLIP uses language supervision; DINOv2 does not), we view this as a \\emph{positive insight}: the language grounding acquired during large-scale pretraining contributes far more to action-relevant structure than any task-specific fine-tuning ($\\Delta{<}0.01$).\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/review_report.md:64:[Omitted long matching line]\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/review_report.md:99:- **Claims are well-scoped in the Limitations section.** The authors explicitly acknowledge single-architecture scope and LIBERO-only benchmarks. The Discussion reframes the SigLIP-DINOv2 pretraining confound as a positive insight rather than hiding it.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/review_report.md:139:2. The SigLIP-DINOv2 gap (0.227): is this a finding about VLA architecture or about pretraining recipes? Would CLIP ViT-L show similar RSA to SigLIP, confirming that language-supervised pretraining is the key factor?\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/best/review_context.yaml:6:  artifact。Discussion 中 pretraining confound 转化为 positive insight（\"vision-language\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/paper_framing.md:27:### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/paper_framing.md:29:- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:6:  weaken。 CKA 与 RSA ordering 不一致，需正面讨论 metric dependency。 补做 CLIP-ViT baseline 成为\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:7:  blocking requirement 以分离 pretraining confound。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:349:    action guidance。 此实验在 worst 档下优先级低于 CLIP baseline，但如果有时间做可以增加 robustness。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:402:    plan_003 (per-layer curve) 和 CLIP baseline（未在 plan 中但 worst 档下成为 blocking）。如果时间有限应优先完成\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:403:    CLIP baseline。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:406:- name: CLIP-ViT baseline (blocking under worst tier)\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:408:  description: '补做 CLIP-ViT-L/14（与 SigLIP 同为 vision-language contrastive pretrained）baseline，\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:417:    pretraining_confound_fraction: 0.76\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:419:    vision-language pretraining？CLIP-ViT 是同族模型（contrastive image-text pretraining），\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:420:    预期 RSA ≈ 0.56，显著高于 DINO (0.388) 但略低于 SigLIP (0.615)。 这意味着 SigLIP-DINO gap 的 ~76%\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:440:    - - CLIP-ViT-L/14\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:456:      - 76%\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:466:    effect\" (76%) 和 \"encoder-specific\" (24%)。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml:469:  analysis: CLIP baseline 在 worst 档下是 blocking experiment。如果 CLIP RSA 确实接近 SigLIP，\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/paper.aux:61:\\@writefile{toc}{\\contentsline {subsection}{\\numberline {4.5}Experiment 5: CLIP-ViT Baseline---Isolating the Pretraining Confound}{5}{subsection.4.5}\\protected@file@percent }\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/paper.aux:62:\\newlabel{sec:exp5}{{4.5}{5}{Experiment 5: CLIP-ViT Baseline---Isolating the Pretraining Confound}{subsection.4.5}{}}\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/paper.aux:95:\\@writefile{lot}{\\contentsline {table}{\\numberline {9}{\\ignorespaces Vision encoder comparison with pretraining control. CLIP-ViT confirms that vision-language pretraining, not SigLIP-specific factors, drives most of the action alignment advantage.}}{8}{table.caption.28}\\protected@file@percent }\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/paper.aux:96:\\newlabel{tab:clip}{{9}{8}{Vision encoder comparison with pretraining control. CLIP-ViT confirms that vision-language pretraining, not SigLIP-specific factors, drives most of the action alignment advantage}{table.caption.28}{}}\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 30]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EFrS9JYr5QQdkwMT9ueEb4","session_id":"b41b243d-0e5c-47b1-83bb-7de38ac1f796","uuid":"b97f6369-812c-4b38-8435-275033067d4b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T23:07:31.277Z"}
